# WFORMTB.KEY - each check of OK failing in turn, in the form of every
# type of TEST/WFORMT.C: the first bad field gets the focus, its text
# selected, and the message line its message, the notes' limits too;
# then OK passes, its notes wrapped; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTB.SNP.
K F5
K ENTER
S REQUIRED
T x
K TAB TAB
T 1-2
K ENTER
S BADNUM
T -5
K ENTER
S NEGNUM
T 5
K TAB
T 1.234
K ENTER
S BADDEC
T 1.23
K TAB
T 2026-02-30
K ENTER
S BADDATE
# Eleven digits: the field takes ten, which are no date.
T 20261024123
K ENTER
S LONGDATE
T 2026-10-24
K ENTER
S CHOICE
# A memo line longer than MEMO_COLS, on the Notes page.
K DOWN CTRL-TAB
T 1234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901
K ENTER
S LINEFULL
# More than MEMO_MAXLINES lines.
T a
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER CTRL-ENTER
K ENTER
S FULL
# More than LINK_MAXMEMO bytes once wrapped: twenty copies of a sentence
# of 100 characters fill the control, and the wrap's line breaks, CR LF
# in place of a blank, take a byte more each.
T  Two full-height Tandon drives came with it; one went to the Compaq, and the other stays in its box.
K CTRL-HOME CTRL-SHIFT-END CTRL-INS CTRL-END
K SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS
K SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS SHIFT-INS
K ENTER
S TOOLONG
# All passes: the dialog ends with WF_OK, the notes wrapped at
# MEMO_COLS, lines of exactly MEMO_COLS characters kept whole and the
# blanks before a word moved dropped; the form again shows them so.  The
# control showed the same four lines (LINES 4 in the frame's title): one
# column less shows five.
T Tandon drive board cards boxes cable mouse modem print fonts Tandon drive board cards boxes cable mouse modem print fonts
T  Tandon drive board cards boxes cable mouse modem print fonts  and a spare keyboard with its cable in the box.
K ENTER
S PASSED
K F5
S WRAPPED
K ESC
